unresolved points counted for the answer, 1 of 5 with them counted against.

## Topic by topic

| Topic (kind) | What blocks it, counted for / against | How settled | Reaches what a reader of the product sees? | Existing record |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| clean-14 (theme figure) | XR / XR | Passes 1 and 3: both third readers fail XR (the reference: IDC's "19% growth" forecast for a unit count). Pass 2 split. | **No.** No judging request, page or service reads the ladder's reference (`gate1-stick/RESULT.md`, re-checked: `bundle.py` reads only `not_judged`, `event`, `figure`). The reference only places the ranges, and X (ranges) holds on all 12 written control sends. | XR not read by the product; an event's reference has no bounded repair (D557, D558); "what counts as an expectation" is an open form issue. |
| clean-15 (theme figure) | L, XR / L, XR | L: pass 1 both first readers; pass 2 both third readers; pass 3 split. XR: pass 1 both first readers. | **Yes, for L:** a part the question leaves out, now shown in the card's list of parts not judged. XR: no. | Line 2's class; no sourced main-part rule (D580); tuning stopped (D586, D391). |
| clean-16 (AI bill) | none / none: three justified refusals | Both families: N holds. | Right. | |
